  Janelia FlyEM hemibrain v1.2 (Scheffer et al. 2020, eLife), CC BY 4.0

  Scheffer, L. K. et al. (2020). A connectome and analysis of the adult Drosophila central brain.
  eLife 9:e57443. https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.57443

  Source: https://storage.googleapis.com/hemibrain/v1.2/exported-traced-adjacencies-v1.2.tar.gz
  (the "compact connection matrix summary", 45,872,577 bytes)

