https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes made: the mushroom-body (projection neurons, Kenyon cells, MBONs, PAM/PPL1 input) and
central-complex (EPG, EPGt, PEN1, PEN2, Delta7, PEG) neurons were selected; their synapse counts were
aggregated and normalised as described in hemibrain.py, which regenerates the file from the source.
The compass angles assigned to central-complex neurons are not part of the dataset (see hemibrain.py).
